WEBVTT

00:00.024 --> 00:07.024
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:07.024 --> 00:09.790
[both screaming]
[vehicle whizzes]
[两人尖叫]
[车辆呼啸]

00:09.790 --> 00:11.024
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

00:11.024 --> 00:12.657
- Look out! Oh!
- 小心！哦！

00:12.657 --> 00:15.590
[smashing]
[screaming]
[粉碎]
[尖叫]

00:17.824 --> 00:19.390
- Learn how to drive!
- 学习如何驾驶！

00:19.390 --> 00:22.924
- I'm trying!
- Calm down, SpongeBob.
- 我想！
- 冷静点，海绵宝宝。

00:22.924 --> 00:24.657
- Yes, Mrs. Puff.
- 是的，帕芙女士。

00:24.657 --> 00:26.024
[ding]
[叮]

00:26.024 --> 00:27.224
Nothing soothes
one's frazzled nerves
没有什么可以舒缓
神经紧张

00:27.224 --> 00:28.224
like blowing bubbles!
就像吹泡泡一样！

00:28.224 --> 00:30.724
[gasps and blows]
[喘气和打击]

00:30.724 --> 00:33.090
- No blowing bubbles
while driving!
- 禁止吹泡泡
开车时！

00:33.090 --> 00:34.557
[bubbles popping
- [groaning]
[气泡破裂
- [呻吟]

00:34.557 --> 00:36.424
- [shrieking]
- [尖叫]

00:37.490 --> 00:38.824
- Phew.
[sighs]
- 唷。
[叹气]

00:38.824 --> 00:40.890
[engines revving]
[发动机转速]

00:40.890 --> 00:43.190
Whoa!
[crash]
哇！
[碰撞]

00:45.324 --> 00:48.057
- [laughing nervously]
- I can't feel my big toe.
- [紧张地笑]
- 我感觉不到我的大脚趾了。

00:48.057 --> 00:49.757
- So, uh, how'd I do?
- 那么，呃，我做得怎么样？

00:49.757 --> 00:51.357
- Get out!
- 出去！

00:51.357 --> 00:54.024
You're never getting
a boating license.
你永远得不到
划船许可证。

00:54.024 --> 00:57.290
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

00:57.290 --> 01:01.424
But--but--
- Never! Never!
但是——但是——
- 从来没有！绝不！

01:01.424 --> 01:03.724
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

01:03.724 --> 01:05.024
[clunk]
[沉闷]

01:05.024 --> 01:07.157
I'll never pass
my driver's test,
我永远不会过去
我的驾驶员考试，

01:07.157 --> 01:08.690
I'll never get my license,
我永远拿不到驾照

01:08.690 --> 01:11.457
and I'll never know the joys
of boat ownership!
我永远不会知道其中的快乐
船舶所有权！

01:11.457 --> 01:14.490
- Ooh...
- It's really nice.
- 哦...
- 真的很好。

01:14.490 --> 01:16.890
[both giggle]
- Oh, yeah, it's a turbo jet.
[两人都咯咯笑]
- 哦，是的，这是一架涡轮喷气发动机。

01:16.890 --> 01:20.824
390 sea horse power
with 11-to-1 pop-up piston.
390 sea horse power
带 11 比 1 弹出式活塞。

01:20.824 --> 01:22.357
[chest revs]
[胸部转速]

01:22.357 --> 01:24.757
We're talking
some serious muscle!
我们正在说话
一些严重的肌肉！

01:24.757 --> 01:27.190
[engine roaring]
[发动机轰鸣]

01:27.190 --> 01:31.090
- I love your boat, Larry!
- 我爱你的船，拉里！

01:31.090 --> 01:33.257
- [murmuring]
- [低语]

01:33.257 --> 01:36.390
[upbeat surf rock music]
[欢快的冲浪摇滚音乐]

01:37.557 --> 01:40.290
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

01:40.290 --> 01:45.890
[hip-hop music playing]
- [singing indistinctly]
[嘻哈音乐播放]
- [含糊不清地唱着]

01:45.890 --> 01:48.090
Oh, hey there, boyo!
哦，嘿，小伙子！

01:48.090 --> 01:52.024
Lovely day for a boat wash.
美好的一天，适合洗船。

01:52.024 --> 01:53.890
Isn't it?
- [whimpering]
不是吗？
- [呜咽]

01:53.890 --> 01:57.024
[sobs]
[抽泣]

01:57.024 --> 01:58.490
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

01:58.490 --> 02:01.024
Maybe I shouldn't have
borrowed Pearl's shorts.
也许我不应该
借了珍珠的短裤。

02:01.024 --> 02:04.424
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

02:04.424 --> 02:07.357
Hey, Patrick,
you want to hang out?
嘿，帕特里克，
你想出去玩吗？

02:07.357 --> 02:09.557
- Wish I could, SpongeBob,
- 希望我能，海绵宝宝，

02:09.557 --> 02:13.624
but I'm kind of spending time
with my boat right now.
但我有点花时间
现在和我的船在一起。

02:13.624 --> 02:15.024
- Your boat.
- 你的船。

02:15.024 --> 02:16.924
Sure, Patrick.
See you later.
当然，帕特里克。
稍后见。

02:16.924 --> 02:18.124
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

02:18.124 --> 02:20.490
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:20.490 --> 02:22.224
Catch!
抓住！

02:23.290 --> 02:25.490
[sad guitar music]
[悲伤的吉他音乐]

02:25.490 --> 02:27.857
- [whimpers]
[sniffles]
- [呜咽]
[抽鼻子]

02:27.857 --> 02:31.190
[inhales and blows]
[吸气并吹气]

02:31.190 --> 02:33.924
- You're a very good driver,
SpongeBob,
- 你是一个非常好的司机
海绵宝宝，

02:33.924 --> 02:36.724
and my favorite student.
和我最喜欢的学生。

02:36.724 --> 02:40.157
Here's your license.
这是你的许可证。

02:40.157 --> 02:42.057
[bubble pops]
[泡泡爆破]

02:42.057 --> 02:44.024
- Ooh!
- 哦！

02:44.024 --> 02:45.624
[bubble pops]
Aww!
[泡泡爆破]
哇！

02:45.624 --> 02:49.690
If only I was as good at driving
as I am at blowing bubbles.
要是我也能开车就好了
就像我在吹泡泡一样。

02:49.690 --> 02:51.024
[squeaks]
[吱吱声]

02:51.024 --> 02:54.024
[gasps]
Oh! That's it!
[喘气]
哦！就是这样！

02:57.024 --> 03:00.057
- Whoa.
- What is that?
- 哇哦。
- 那是什么？

03:00.057 --> 03:03.057
[lively jazz music]
[活泼的爵士乐]

03:03.057 --> 03:05.324
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:05.324 --> 03:09.024
both: Oh!
- All right, all right.
两人：哦！
- 好吧，好吧。

03:09.024 --> 03:12.857
[squeaky bouncing]
[both swooning]
[吱吱弹跳]
[两人都晕倒了]

03:12.857 --> 03:15.190
[crash]
[碰撞]

03:15.190 --> 03:18.557
[squeaky bouncing]
[siren wails]
[吱吱弹跳]
[警报声]

03:18.557 --> 03:20.524
Pleasant day for a drive,
hey, Officer?
开车出行的愉快一天，
嘿，警官？

03:20.524 --> 03:25.790
- Sir, I'm going to need to see
your license for that, um...
- 先生，我需要看看
你的许可证，嗯...

03:25.790 --> 03:29.657
- [laughs] You don't need
a license to drive a bubble.
- [笑]你不需要
驾驶泡沫的许可证。

03:29.657 --> 03:31.890
- Hmm, I suppose you're right.
- 嗯，我想你是对的。

03:31.890 --> 03:33.290
Carry on, citizen.
继续吧，公民。

03:33.290 --> 03:34.624
[squeaky bouncing]
[吱吱弹跳]

03:36.057 --> 03:40.290
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:40.290 --> 03:42.190
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:42.190 --> 03:43.524
- Gary!
- [yowls]
- 加里！
- [嚎叫]

03:43.524 --> 03:44.790
- You'll never believe it.
- 你永远不会相信。

03:44.790 --> 03:46.357
I was out driving all day.
我整天开车出去。

03:46.357 --> 03:47.724
Yes, driving!
是的，开车！

03:47.724 --> 03:49.457
First I drove down
the street like this!
首先我开车下来
街道是这样的！

03:49.457 --> 03:51.524
[tires squealing]
[imitates engine vrooming]
[轮胎吱吱声]
[模仿发动机运转]

03:51.524 --> 03:53.290
Then I made a right turn
on red like this.
然后我右转
像这样的红色。

03:53.290 --> 03:56.590
[tires squealing]
[imitates engine vrooming]
[轮胎吱吱声]
[模仿发动机运转]

03:56.590 --> 03:58.157
You should've been there, Gary.
你应该在那儿，加里。

03:58.157 --> 03:59.824
Oh, it was like
a dream come true.
哦，就像
梦想成真。

03:59.824 --> 04:02.457
- [grumbling] Meow.
[snores]
- [抱怨] 喵。
[打鼾]

04:02.457 --> 04:05.590
[knock at door]
- Hmm?
[敲门]
- 嗯？

04:05.590 --> 04:08.924
- I'm here for a bubble boat.
- Yeah, me too!
- 我来这里是为了一艘泡泡船。
- 是的，我也是！

04:08.924 --> 04:10.457
- I want one!
- Uh, yeah, yeah, me too.
- 我想要一个！
- 呃，是的，是的，我也是。

04:10.457 --> 04:12.324
- Yes, please.
- One, please.
- 是的，请。
- 请来一张。

04:12.324 --> 04:13.724
- Oh, I'm not sure
I have enough soap
- 哦，我不确定
我有足够的肥皂

04:13.724 --> 04:15.624
to make this many
bubble boats.
使这么多
泡泡船。

04:15.624 --> 04:18.024
- Please?
- 请？

04:18.024 --> 04:21.824
- Well, I suppose I could tap
into my rainy day reserves.
- 嗯，我想我可以点击
进入我的未雨绸缪储备。

04:24.124 --> 04:25.790
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:25.790 --> 04:27.457
Gah.
Gah!
嘎。
嘎！

04:30.190 --> 04:31.490
- [excited grunting]
- [兴奋的咕哝]

04:33.524 --> 04:36.324
- One bubble boat coming up!
- 一艘泡泡船即将出现！

04:36.324 --> 04:38.757
[inhales and blows]
[吸气并吹气]

04:38.757 --> 04:40.257
- Thank you!
- 谢谢你！

04:40.257 --> 04:41.790
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

04:41.790 --> 04:43.657
- Down here, idiot!
- 在这里，白痴！

04:43.657 --> 04:47.524
I want to strike fear
in the hearts of other drivers.
我想要打击恐惧
在其他司机的心中。

04:47.524 --> 04:51.490
You got something terrifying
in that wand for me, SpongeBob?
你有一些可怕的东西
海绵宝宝，给我的那根魔杖？

04:51.490 --> 04:53.390
- I sure do, Plankton!
- 我当然知道，浮游生物！

04:53.390 --> 04:55.490
[inhales and blows]
[吸气并吹气]

04:55.490 --> 04:58.024
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

04:58.024 --> 05:01.424
[boing]
- Oof!
[嗡嗡声]
- 噢！

05:01.424 --> 05:04.024
[air hissing]
[空气嘶嘶声]

05:04.024 --> 05:05.657
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:05.657 --> 05:10.124
Ha-ha-ha, you fool!
Now I will rule the streets!
哈哈哈哈你这个傻瓜！
现在我将统治街道！

05:10.124 --> 05:11.357
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

05:11.357 --> 05:13.024
Ouch!
哎哟!

05:13.024 --> 05:15.057
[strained shouting]
[紧张的喊叫]

05:15.057 --> 05:18.690
[groaning]
Strike fear...
[呻吟]
打击恐惧...

05:18.690 --> 05:23.357
- Hmm...blow me something
that screams Larry, SpongeBob.
- 嗯...给我吹点东西
拉里尖叫着，海绵宝宝。

05:23.357 --> 05:25.590
- I'm on it, Larry!
- 我会的，拉里！

05:25.590 --> 05:28.924
[inhales and blows]
[吸气并吹气]

05:28.924 --> 05:31.390
[inhales sharply]
[猛吸一口气]

05:31.390 --> 05:35.024
- Now, this is what I call
a muscle car!
- 现在，这就是我所说的
一辆肌肉车！

05:35.024 --> 05:37.024
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:37.024 --> 05:38.557
- I love your boat, Larry!
- 我爱你的船，拉里！

05:38.557 --> 05:41.690
[squeaky flexing]
[吱吱作响]

05:45.924 --> 05:47.124
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

05:47.124 --> 05:48.724
I'll never blow
enough bubble boats
我永远不会吹
足够的泡泡船

05:48.724 --> 05:50.124
at this rate.
按照这个速度。

05:50.124 --> 05:51.524
Yahoo!
雅虎！

05:53.490 --> 05:55.857
[inhales]
[grunts]
[吸气]
[咕哝]

05:55.857 --> 05:57.390
[pop]
[流行音乐]

05:57.390 --> 05:59.657
[all cheer]
[大家欢呼]

06:01.590 --> 06:05.224
- [humming]
Greetings, class.
- [嗡嗡声]
同学们，大家好。

06:05.224 --> 06:07.690
My name is--
[gasps]
我的名字是——
[喘气]

06:07.690 --> 06:12.357
[startled stammer]
Mrs. Puff.
[吃惊的结巴]
泡芙女士。

06:12.357 --> 06:15.190
Oh, now that everyone's
driving bubbles,
哦，既然大家都
驱动气泡，

06:15.190 --> 06:17.290
they don't need licenses.
他们不需要许可证。

06:17.290 --> 06:18.857
[sighs]
[叹气]

06:18.857 --> 06:21.457
I guess there's just
no place in this world
我想只有
这个世界上没有一个地方

06:21.457 --> 06:25.890
for an old driving instructor.
对于一位老驾驶教练来说。

06:25.890 --> 06:29.324
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:29.324 --> 06:30.757
Oh!
哦！

06:30.757 --> 06:32.557
Bah!
- Hey, watch it, lady!
呸!
- 嘿，注意点，女士！

06:32.557 --> 06:34.757
- Ah!
- I'm driving over here!
- 啊！
- 我开车过来！

06:34.757 --> 06:36.524
- Hey, hey, hey, hey!
- Oh--wah!
- 嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿！
- 哦——哇！

06:36.524 --> 06:39.024
- Hey! pick a lane,
butter-brain!
- 嘿！选择一条车道，
黄油脑！

06:39.024 --> 06:41.190
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

06:41.190 --> 06:44.890
[screams]
[bubbles popping]
[尖叫声]
[气泡破裂]

06:44.890 --> 06:47.157
[siren wails]
[警报声]

06:47.157 --> 06:49.924
- I'm going to have to ask you
to step out of the boat, ma'am.
- 我得问你
走出船，女士。

06:49.924 --> 06:51.557
Do you know why
I pulled you over?
你知道为什么吗
我把你拉过来了？

06:51.557 --> 06:54.224
- You ran my plates
and saw my rap sheet?
- 你跑了我的盘子
看到我的犯罪记录了吗？

06:54.224 --> 06:55.624
- What? No.
- 什么？不。

06:55.624 --> 06:58.024
Your vehicle
has been outlawed, ma'am.
您的车辆
已经被取缔了，女士。

06:58.024 --> 06:59.424
[tow truck beeping]
[拖车嘟嘟声]

06:59.424 --> 07:01.024
Now that everyone drives
bubble boats,
现在大家都开车
泡泡船、

07:01.024 --> 07:03.257
real boats have been deemed
too sharp and pointy
真正的船已被视为
太尖锐

07:03.257 --> 07:04.757
to be street legal.
街头合法。

07:04.757 --> 07:07.590
- But I've never
driven a bubble.
- 但我从来没有
推动了泡沫。

07:10.024 --> 07:12.390
Bubble boating school?
泡泡船学校？

07:14.057 --> 07:16.257
Please don't be SpongeBob.
Please don't be SpongeBob.
请不要成为海绵宝宝。
请不要成为海绵宝宝。

07:16.257 --> 07:18.924
Please don't be SpongeBob.
Please don't be SpongeBob.
请不要成为海绵宝宝。
请不要成为海绵宝宝。

07:18.924 --> 07:20.724
Please don't be SpongeBob.
请不要成为海绵宝宝。

07:20.724 --> 07:23.057
- Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
- 呼呼呼！

07:23.057 --> 07:24.624
[smash]
[thud]
[粉碎]
[砰]

07:24.624 --> 07:26.890
Hi, Mrs. Puff.
- Of course.
嗨，普芙女士。
- 当然。

07:26.890 --> 07:28.857
- You must be here
for the bubble lessons.
- 你一定在这儿
泡泡课。

07:28.857 --> 07:31.424
Don't worry, Mrs. P.
[blows]
别担心，P 女士。
[打击]

07:31.424 --> 07:33.257
You'll be learning
from a master.
你将会学习到
来自一位大师。

07:33.257 --> 07:36.390
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:37.357 --> 07:39.690
[bubble pops]
Whoa!
[泡泡爆破]
哇！

07:39.690 --> 07:41.090
[belches]
[pop]
[打嗝]
[流行音乐]

07:41.090 --> 07:42.324
[laughs]
[笑]

07:42.324 --> 07:43.590
- Great.
- 伟大的。

07:45.224 --> 07:48.424
- Now, to get your bubble going,
just pump your legs like this.
- 现在，为了让你的泡沫继续下去，
像这样打动你的腿。

07:48.424 --> 07:51.190
[imitates pumping noises]
[模仿泵的声音]

07:51.190 --> 07:54.090
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

07:54.090 --> 07:55.590
[wallops]
- Oh! Ooh!
[冲击力]
- 哦！哦！

07:55.590 --> 07:58.524
Oh!
- Nice start.
哦！
- 不错的开始。

08:01.324 --> 08:03.424
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

08:03.424 --> 08:06.190
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

08:06.190 --> 08:12.724
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:12.724 --> 08:14.457
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

08:14.457 --> 08:16.257
[moans]
[呻吟声]

08:16.257 --> 08:18.157
Oh!
[flames whooshing]
哦！
[火焰呼啸]

08:18.157 --> 08:21.490
Fire!
火！

08:21.490 --> 08:23.257
[crash]
[flames whooshing]
[崩溃]
[火焰呼啸]

08:23.257 --> 08:25.490
[fire truck horn honks]
[消防车喇叭鸣响]

08:27.124 --> 08:29.224
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:29.224 --> 08:31.690
[exhales]
[呼气]

08:31.690 --> 08:34.024
[panting]
[tires squealing]
[气喘吁吁]
[轮胎吱吱声]

08:34.024 --> 08:36.624
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

08:36.624 --> 08:38.357
Oh! Ah!
[tires squealing]
哦！啊!
[轮胎吱吱声]

08:38.357 --> 08:41.457
Hmm. Hah. Eeh.
[tires screeching]
唔。哈。呃。
[轮胎的尖叫声]

08:41.457 --> 08:43.257
I did it.
我做到了。

08:43.257 --> 08:45.424
- Mrs. Puff,
you're ready.
- 普芙女士，
你准备好了。

08:45.424 --> 08:47.590
- Really?
- Absolutely!
- 真的吗？
- 绝对地！

08:47.590 --> 08:49.790
You just need to pass
your final test...
你只需要通过
你的最终测试...

08:49.790 --> 08:51.090
out there.
在那里。

08:51.090 --> 08:52.657
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:52.657 --> 08:54.657
- [whimpering]
Oh.
- [呜咽]
哦。

08:54.657 --> 08:57.357
[lively jazz music]
[活泼的爵士乐]

08:57.357 --> 09:00.657
- Nice and easy.
Doing great.
- 又好又容易。
做得很好。

09:02.124 --> 09:03.124
- Hello!
- 你好！

09:04.724 --> 09:07.490
- You know, this whole
bubble boating thing
- 你知道，这整个
泡泡船的事

09:07.490 --> 09:08.824
isn't so bad.
还不错。

09:08.824 --> 09:10.490
[laughs]
Maybe I could--
[笑]
也许我可以——

09:10.490 --> 09:12.457
- Oh, no, Mrs. Puff!
- 哦，不，帕夫夫人！

09:12.457 --> 09:14.557
You got on the freeway
by mistake!
你上了高速公路
错误地！

09:14.557 --> 09:15.624
Look out!
当心！

09:15.624 --> 09:17.157
- [yelping]
- [尖叫]

09:17.157 --> 09:20.357
[horn honks]
- It's okay! Just calm down!
[喇叭鸣响]
- 没关系！冷静点！

09:20.357 --> 09:23.524
- Eeh! Oh!
[tires squealing]
- 呃！哦！
[轮胎吱吱声]

09:23.524 --> 09:26.257
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

09:26.257 --> 09:29.057
[boinging]
[轰鸣声]

09:29.057 --> 09:30.424
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

09:30.424 --> 09:31.857
- Ah! Ah!
[horn honks]
- 啊！啊!
[喇叭鸣响]

09:31.857 --> 09:34.424
Ah!
[screaming]
啊!
[尖叫]

09:34.424 --> 09:36.624
- Oh!
[both screaming]
- 哦！
[两人尖叫]

09:36.624 --> 09:38.424
[boing]
- [mumbles]
[嗡嗡声]
- [咕哝]

09:38.424 --> 09:40.524
- Oh!
- [screams]
- 哦！
- [尖叫]

09:40.524 --> 09:42.057
[crash]
[muffled grunt]
[崩溃]
[低沉的咕噜声]

09:42.057 --> 09:44.290
Ah!
- [sighs]
啊!
- [叹气]

09:44.290 --> 09:47.824
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:47.824 --> 09:50.624
- Oh, no. What's gonna happen
when they hit the surface?
- 哦，不。会发生什么
当它们到达表面时？

09:50.624 --> 09:52.657
- [murmuring]
- [低语]

09:52.657 --> 09:55.857
[bubbles popping]
[all screaming]
[气泡破裂]
[所有人尖叫]

09:57.290 --> 09:58.924
- [inhales sharply]
- [猛吸一口气]

09:58.924 --> 10:01.190
[blowing]
[吹]

10:01.190 --> 10:04.124
[intense breathing]
[剧烈呼吸]

10:06.024 --> 10:07.024
[inhales sharply]
[猛吸一口气]

10:07.024 --> 10:09.057
[bubbles blipping]
[泡泡爆破]

10:09.057 --> 10:11.024
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:11.024 --> 10:12.090
- Oh!
- 哦！

10:12.090 --> 10:14.890
- Doh!
[inhales and blows]
- 噢！
[吸气并吹气]

10:14.890 --> 10:16.090
[boing]
[bubble pops]
[嗡嗡声]
[泡泡爆破]

10:16.090 --> 10:17.090
- No more bubbles.
- 不再有气泡。

10:17.090 --> 10:18.057
Get them off me!
把他们从我身上拿开！

10:18.057 --> 10:19.390
- Don't worry, Mrs. Puff.
- 别担心，帕芙女士。

10:19.390 --> 10:20.524
Even though it was bubbles
虽然是泡沫

10:20.524 --> 10:21.890
that caused
all these problems,
导致
所有这些问题，

10:21.890 --> 10:23.890
it was also bubbles
that solved 'em.
也是泡沫
这解决了他们。

10:23.890 --> 10:26.124
That's kind of a wash, I guess.
我想，这就是一种洗礼。

10:26.124 --> 10:27.257
Get it? Wash?
得到它？洗？

10:27.257 --> 10:29.824
Soap? Bubbles?
[laughs]
肥皂？气泡？
[笑]

10:29.824 --> 10:32.524
- Give me that.
Bubble boats are too unstable.
- 给我那个。
泡泡船太不稳定了。

10:32.524 --> 10:34.824
They've been declared
illegal.
他们已被宣布
非法的。

10:34.824 --> 10:37.490
Everyone back
to your regular boats!
大家都回来了
到您的常规船只！

10:37.490 --> 10:40.024
[snap]
[grunts and grumbles]
[啪]
[咕哝和抱怨]

10:40.024 --> 10:42.290
- Well, Mrs. Puff,
looks like I have to get
- 嗯，普芙夫人，
看起来我必须得到

10:42.290 --> 10:43.924
my boating license after all.
毕竟我的划船执照。

10:43.924 --> 10:45.357
See you tomorrow in class!
明天课堂见！

10:45.357 --> 10:48.224
* La-la-la-la, la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la *
* 啦啦啦啦，啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦*

10:48.224 --> 10:50.724
- Oh, joy.
[pop]
- 哦，快乐。
[流行音乐]

- Oh, joy.
[流行音乐]